  "headline": "Cephalexin is not on FDA's shortage list as of 2026-10-21; supply traces to a repack plant inspected VAI 2024-09-06",
  "headline_cites": ["D4", "E5", "E4"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA's drug shortage list does not include cephalexin as of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": ["D4"]
    },
    {
      "text": "All three Corvale sites stock cephalexin 500 mg capsules labeled by Advanced Rx Pharmacy of Tennessee, LLC (NDC 80425012101).",
      "cites": ["E1", "E2", "E3"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The product label identifies the repack plant as Advanced Rx Pharmacy of Tennessee, LLC (FEI 3017450153).",
      "cites": ["E5"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA inspection 1249914 at that plant ended 2024-09-06 with a VAI classification.",
      "cites": ["E4"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale East has 5 days on hand (88 capsules at 17.5/day) and Corvale General has 26.5 days (399 capsules at 15.1/day).",
      "cites": ["D1", "D2"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The top-ranked option is to transfer 157 capsules from Corvale General to Corvale East, leaving General with 16 days and bringing East to 14 days.",
      "cites": ["D5"]
    }
  ]
}
